  "description": "Aero-style (Windows 7 and Office 2010) themes for Actipro and native WPF controls.\n\nThis package is only needed if older Aero-style themes are required for your application.  Newer modern themes are already included in the Actipro Shared Library.\n\nDocumentation is available on the Actipro web site (https://www.actiprosoftware.com/docs/controls/wpf/index?v=25.1), and samples can be downloaded from the Actipro WPF Controls GitHub repository (https://github.com/Actipro/WPF-Controls).\n\nNOTE: This is a commercial software product and requires proper paid licensing for legal usage. See Actipro's web site (https://www.actiprosoftware.com/purchase) for links to purchase developer licenses, or view the Sales FAQ for more information about evaluations and licensing.",
